Subject: [PATCH] services: create a simpler stub registration for multinet

---
 .../init/c_registration/02_multinet_stub.c    | 58 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../scripts/init/c_registration/Makefile.am   |  2 +-
 2 files changed, 59 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 source/scripts/init/c_registration/02_multinet_stub.c

diff --git a/source/scripts/init/c_registration/02_multinet_stub.c b/source/scripts/init/c_registration/02_multinet_stub.c
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..2f34c3d
--- /dev/null
+++ b/source/scripts/init/c_registration/02_multinet_stub.c
@@ -0,0 +1,58 @@
+/*
